Date: Thu,  8 Feb 2018 14:01:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH v3 1/4] ARM: dts: sunxi: h3-h5: remove mmc0 card detection pin
 from pinctrl
In-Reply-To: <20180208120141.15780-1-joonas.kylmala@iki.fi>
References: <20180208120141.15780-1-joonas.kylmala@iki.fi>
Message-ID: <20180208120141.15780-2-joonas.kylmala@iki.fi>
To: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
List-Id: linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org

The GPIO card detection pin (mmc0_cd_pin) is already requested and
configured by mmc_gpiod_request_cd() in drivers/mmc/core/slot-gpio.c
so pinctrl is not needed.

Signed-off-by: Joonas Kylm?l? <joonas.kylmala@iki.fi>
